  "summaries": [
    {
      "id": 204200,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "It was possible to bypass [Lock WARP switch feature](https://developers.cloudflare.com/cloudflare-one/connections/connect-devices/warp/warp-settings/#lock-warp-switch) on WARP iOS mobile client by enabling both \"Disable for cellular networks\" and \"Disable for Wi-Fi networks\" switches at once in the application settings. Such configuration caused WARP client to disconnect and allowed the user to bypass restrictions and policies enforced by the Zero Trust platform.\nThe issue was fixed in version 6.14 of the iOS mobile client.",
